{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>宏福苑火災至今一年，居民、市民自發回到宏福苑悼念。多次就事件接受傳媒訪問的居民何小姐表示，踏入 11 月起已不時被不明人士跟蹤，最近的一次更尾隨她往住所。<br/><br/>11 月 26 日大火一周年，何小姐和不少居民到廣福道休憩處獻花。何小姐之後跟約十個街坊，相約到元洲仔公園逛逛相聚，《集誌社》訪問和拍攝期間，留意到至少有一名男士一直尾隨約半小時。何小姐說，跟蹤使她近期變得疑神疑鬼，如今出門會四處張望，惟強調不會因而停止發聲。<br/><br/>相關報道：<a href=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e5%a4%a7%e7%81%ab%e4%b8%80%e5%b9%b4%ef%bd%9c%e6%8b%92%e8%b3%a3%e6%a5%ad%e6%ac%8a%e4%bd%95%e5%b0%8f%e5%a7%90%e3%80%80%e9%80%a3%e6%97%a5%e6%87%b7%e7%96%91%e8%a2%ab%e8%b7%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑大火一年｜拒賣業權何小姐　連日懷疑被跟蹤　「不如你直接埋來同我講」</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"237\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Payme-500x237.png\" width=\"500\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.709059+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":251,"images":1,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T11:03:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:17:34.117546+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:16.578885+00:00","content_hash":"411a965404364a06c507e63a8e1e647bb1e7625bb20bda695d1fd98d0f1d6da7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}